WEBVTT

00:02.560 --> 00:06.480
<b><i>Someday, that child is going to
destroy the family Magecraft!</i></b>

00:07.360 --> 00:11.320
<b><i>A child named Flat never
existed to begin with!</i></b>

00:15.240 --> 00:18.000
<b>Are you Flat Escardos?</b>

00:19.620 --> 00:20.290
<b>Yes!</b>

00:21.000 --> 00:22.920
<b>What's with that face?</b>

00:23.880 --> 00:28.300
<b>Your mimetic muscles are moving in an
order that ignores its intended functions.</b>

00:28.300 --> 00:31.260
<b>Only caring about the ends
while neglecting the means...</b>

00:31.260 --> 00:32.970
<b>That is an immature thought process.</b>

00:33.300 --> 00:36.010
<b>If that's your way of
getting around in this world,</b>

00:36.010 --> 00:38.100
<b>you should alter your way of thinking.</b>

00:38.470 --> 00:40.060
<b>Ow!</b>

00:41.060 --> 00:44.900
<b>I'm telling you, children
should not be faking smiles.</b>

00:48.900 --> 00:51.610
<b>These fashion choices
really feel like you.</b>

00:51.990 --> 00:52.910
<b>Don't they?</b>

00:53.570 --> 00:56.240
<b>It's perfect for an
infiltration mission, right?</b>

00:56.700 --> 00:57.740
<b>Humph.</b>

00:58.120 --> 00:59.700
<b>I would have agreed...</b>

01:00.000 --> 01:04.130
<b>if we were heading into
a disco full of cowboys.</b>

02:39.470 --> 02:41.600
<b>This doesn't really feel like reality.</b>

02:42.180 --> 02:45.640
<b>Are we really being
watched by Special Ops?</b>

02:46.560 --> 02:50.820
<b>Moreover, the American government joining
forces with Mages in a conspiracy?</b>

02:51.570 --> 02:53.320
<b>What is this, a fantasy movie?</b>

02:53.940 --> 02:56.150
<b>Yes. I was surprised, as well.</b>

02:56.530 --> 02:58.240
<b>But it also makes sense.</b>

02:59.200 --> 03:01.450
<b>You kinda look like you're having fun.</b>

03:01.830 --> 03:03.790
<b>I... looked like I was having fun?</b>

03:07.290 --> 03:12.670
<b>Are you not gonna tell them that
there is a vampire in the hospital?</b>

03:12.670 --> 03:16.670
<b>I'd like to keep some cards up my
sleeve, just in case something happens.</b>

03:16.670 --> 03:17.590
<b>Oh?</b>

03:18.550 --> 03:20.800
<b>I believe... they are good people.</b>

03:21.720 --> 03:24.520
<b>But this is how I have lived my life.</b>

03:26.180 --> 03:27.190
<b>You...</b>

03:27.600 --> 03:29.690
<b>that assassin girl...</b>

03:29.690 --> 03:31.520
<b>Quite the troublesome folks.</b>

03:39.280 --> 03:41.280
<b>Only you five showed up, huh?</b>

03:41.700 --> 03:47.080
<b>So? How'd you feel fighting a real
monster and almost being killed?</b>

03:47.080 --> 03:48.750
<b>Th-That's—</b>

03:48.750 --> 03:53.840
<b>First of all, why do you
go so far to keep fighting?</b>

03:54.170 --> 03:58.930
<b>What is there to gain by standing
at the front line of this war...</b>

03:58.930 --> 04:01.260
<b>where people can die at any moment?</b>

04:02.510 --> 04:03.470
<b>I...</b>

04:04.140 --> 04:06.310
<b>We are police officers!</b>

04:06.970 --> 04:09.730
<b>It's our job to save as
many people as possible</b>

04:09.730 --> 04:13.940
<b>under conditions where
we may die at any moment!</b>

04:14.360 --> 04:18.400
<b>You're glorifying things.
Does doing that put food on the table?</b>

04:18.990 --> 04:21.360
<b>I know that you built a giant mansion.</b>

04:21.660 --> 04:24.330
<b>Hah, you sure have got some words!</b>

04:24.830 --> 04:28.410
<b>Are you saying my works
are glorifications?</b>

04:30.620 --> 04:32.330
<b>You're exactly right.</b>

04:32.790 --> 04:33.750
<b>Huh?</b>

04:33.750 --> 04:38.260
<b>An overglorified protagonist who sees
their will through to the end...</b>

04:38.800 --> 04:41.340
<b>sells really well, actually.</b>

04:42.300 --> 04:46.930
<b>There's a special gimmick, so I'll
explain all sorts of stuff later.</b>

04:47.600 --> 04:48.640
<b>But, I—</b>

04:48.640 --> 04:51.730
<b>John Wingard, 28 years old.</b>

04:51.730 --> 04:53.650
<b>The second son in a family of Mages.</b>

04:54.310 --> 04:56.100
<b>Aspired to become a police officer</b>

04:56.100 --> 04:59.360
<b>after losing his mother in
a terrorist attack on an airplane.</b>

04:59.740 --> 05:06.080
<b>Because you didn't want any person to end
up with the same sadness as yourself.</b>

05:06.080 --> 05:07.790
<b>It's nothing like that.</b>

05:07.790 --> 05:09.580
<b>I simply wanted revenge—</b>

05:09.580 --> 05:13.120
<b>It's fine. I'm still going to glorify
it into something like that.</b>

05:13.120 --> 05:15.790
<b>If revenge is what you actually
want, then revenge it is.</b>

05:16.500 --> 05:21.220
<b>I originally had no interest
in plays or novels.</b>

05:21.220 --> 05:24.760
<b>I was just tired of seeing
nothing but boring tragedies.</b>

05:25.340 --> 05:31.230
<b>But one day... I saw a tragedy called
"Hamlet," and that was something else.</b>

05:31.230 --> 05:33.140
<b>I was overwhelmed.</b>

05:33.140 --> 05:35.810
<b>It ended up being one of
my greatest inspirations.</b>

05:36.690 --> 05:38.020
<b>However...</b>

05:38.570 --> 05:41.880
<b>the Hamlet I saw was the
one where old man Ducis</b>

05:41.880 --> 05:44.240
<b>broke the original work into pieces...</b>

05:44.240 --> 05:47.330
<b>and rewrote it with his
own interpretation.</b>

05:47.830 --> 05:51.340
<b>When I later read the real
thing written by Shakespeare,</b>

05:51.340 --> 05:53.290
<b>I got all weak in the knees.</b>

05:53.790 --> 06:00.590
<b>Compared to the real thing, what I
saw was truly just a wannabe Hamlet.</b>

06:02.300 --> 06:04.970
<b>But what changed <i>my</i> life...</b>

06:05.470 --> 06:07.430
<b>was that wannabe.</b>

06:07.970 --> 06:10.520
<b>That is something I won't let anyone deny.</b>

06:10.890 --> 06:13.350
<b>Fake or whatever...</b>

06:13.640 --> 06:18.400
<b>the passion packed in there
was real. That's all!</b>

06:22.240 --> 06:25.200
<b>The Noble Phantasms I create are fake...</b>

06:25.490 --> 06:28.530
<b>but the passion your boss
has is the real thing.</b>

06:28.990 --> 06:31.160
<b>If you believe him through to the end,</b>

06:31.160 --> 06:34.540
<b>you should be able to overturn
as many of those real legends...</b>

06:34.540 --> 06:38.000
<b>as you need to.</b>

06:40.920 --> 06:41.920
<b>Come in.</b>

06:43.260 --> 06:46.050
<b>Chief, there's something
urgent I need to report.</b>

06:46.510 --> 06:47.640
<b>Release me!</b>

06:48.140 --> 06:49.850
<b>I'm innocent!</b>

06:49.850 --> 06:51.220
<b>Sit still!</b>

06:53.520 --> 06:55.440
<b>We're in, Mr. Jack!</b>

06:57.520 --> 06:58.440
<b>Infiltration...</b>

06:59.110 --> 07:00.900
<b>is his intent, perhaps?</b>

07:01.270 --> 07:03.150
<b>When we found him at the park...</b>

07:03.690 --> 07:07.360
<b>the report said a cop and
a woman in a dress...</b>

07:07.910 --> 07:10.240
<b>suddenly appeared and disappeared, right?</b>

07:10.240 --> 07:11.160
<b>Yes.</b>

07:11.160 --> 07:13.790
<b>It is likely an ability of the Servant.</b>

07:14.620 --> 07:17.250
<b>He should be off duty today.</b>

07:18.210 --> 07:21.090
<b>I will gather nearby Clan
Calatin members immediately.</b>

07:21.090 --> 07:21.710
<b>Right.</b>

07:22.420 --> 07:23.550
<b>Also...</b>

07:26.010 --> 07:27.760
<b>who the hell are you?</b>

07:30.430 --> 07:32.890
<b>I thought we had a ceasefire.</b>

07:32.890 --> 07:35.640
<b>I don't trust you.</b>

07:36.100 --> 07:38.520
<b>Where do your beliefs lie?</b>

07:39.480 --> 07:42.190
<b>I don't believe in anything.</b>

07:42.190 --> 07:43.230
<b>Not in my client...</b>

07:43.570 --> 07:46.150
<b>not in Magecraft, not in myself.</b>

07:46.650 --> 07:50.450
<b>You don't have a god that
you send your prayers to?</b>

07:51.240 --> 07:52.450
<b>I...</b>

07:52.780 --> 07:55.660
<b>have yet to receive a god's favor.</b>

07:56.330 --> 07:59.200
<b>The people who raised me</b>

07:59.200 --> 08:02.630
<b>dragged fetuses out of mothers'
wombs to experiment on them.</b>

08:02.920 --> 08:05.630
<b>For the sole purpose of creating
spellcasters that kill people.</b>

08:07.050 --> 08:08.300
<b>They said...</b>

08:08.300 --> 08:11.220
<b>those who commanded our country were gods.</b>

08:11.840 --> 08:14.470
<b>But they were annihilated. So...</b>

08:15.470 --> 08:19.690
<b>I don't have a grasp of
what this god thing is.</b>

08:20.730 --> 08:21.650
<b>I see.</b>

08:22.360 --> 08:23.560
<b>Sorry.</b>

08:23.560 --> 08:26.110
<b>I have made you confront
such harsh memories.</b>

08:26.730 --> 08:29.610
<b>You are different from the other Mages.</b>

08:30.110 --> 08:33.200
<b>Your eyes truly look like they
don't believe in anything.</b>

08:33.990 --> 08:38.910
<b>That is likely because you have yet to
discover what is worth believing in.</b>

08:39.710 --> 08:43.250
<b>I have no right to speak
of faith at present.</b>

08:44.130 --> 08:45.380
<b>However...</b>

08:45.380 --> 08:48.210
<b>I hope that someday...</b>

08:48.210 --> 08:51.470
<b>when it is created within you,
your faith will be of good nature.</b>

08:56.970 --> 08:59.270
<b>I'm surprised, my boy!</b>

08:59.270 --> 09:02.650
<b>It looks like you're quite
the charming swindler.</b>

09:03.150 --> 09:04.230
<b>What's wrong?</b>

09:04.980 --> 09:07.690
<b>It can't be love at first sight, can it?</b>

09:08.360 --> 09:09.440
<b>No.</b>

09:09.780 --> 09:11.900
<b>This is the first time someone has wanted</b>

09:11.900 --> 09:14.530
<b>something from me outside
of Francesca's begging.</b>

09:15.950 --> 09:17.790
<b>What is the meaning of this?</b>

09:18.490 --> 09:21.910
<b>Can I take this as a form
of workplace harassment?</b>

09:22.330 --> 09:25.500
<b>You say things that the real
Vera might actually say.</b>

09:26.040 --> 09:28.000
<b>You still doubt me?</b>

09:29.760 --> 09:31.470
<b>The real Vera...</b>

09:31.800 --> 09:33.930
<b>is currently headed to
the monitoring room.</b>

09:35.930 --> 09:37.600
<b>I was able to read it just now.</b>

09:38.680 --> 09:40.600
<b>An IC chip in the neck.</b>

09:40.980 --> 09:44.600
<b>Something that complicated
cannot be copied instantly.</b>

09:45.350 --> 09:47.060
<b>A machine, huh?</b>

09:47.520 --> 09:48.780
<b>Indeed, something like that...</b>

09:49.400 --> 09:51.240
<b>I wouldn't be able to figure out.</b>

09:57.660 --> 09:58.620
<b><i>Play Ball.</i></b>

10:01.910 --> 10:04.040
<b>You tamed the Demonic Beasts?</b>

10:07.380 --> 10:08.460
<b><i>Game Set.</i></b>

10:12.590 --> 10:15.470
<b>You took over the police station's system?</b>

10:15.800 --> 10:17.970
<b>Please stand down from
your attack posture...</b>

10:18.680 --> 10:20.850
<b>Police Chief Orlando Reeve.</b>

10:21.430 --> 10:23.730
<b>Roughly 40 percent of the personnel
within this police station...</b>

10:24.270 --> 10:26.560
<b>are all me at this point.</b>

10:32.190 --> 10:35.570
<b>It seems you have gained
the upper hand here.</b>

10:35.910 --> 10:38.030
<b>Oh, I'm glad you understand.</b>

10:38.990 --> 10:41.370
<b>You show just a part of your powers...</b>

10:41.950 --> 10:44.210
<b>to make the negotiations
advantageous to you.</b>

10:44.580 --> 10:46.540
<b>This is just like what the mafia does.</b>

10:47.000 --> 10:51.050
<b>Oh, no. All of the bounded fields
were connected to you, Mr. Chief...</b>

10:51.050 --> 10:53.670
<b>so I was trying to have
him check things out...</b>

10:53.670 --> 10:56.470
<b>but I didn't think we'd get caught.</b>

10:56.840 --> 10:59.180
<b>I'm sorry to have surprised you!</b>

11:00.010 --> 11:00.890
<b>Hah.</b>

11:01.220 --> 11:03.390
<b>To think there'd be a Mage like you...</b>

11:04.230 --> 11:06.100
<b>So, what do you want?</b>

11:06.600 --> 11:09.520
<b>There's no way you're here
to make an alliance, are you?</b>

11:09.520 --> 11:10.480
<b>We came here...</b>

11:10.980 --> 11:12.690
<b>to file a report!</b>

11:15.030 --> 11:17.450
<b>Oh, you mean the fire in
the industrial district.</b>

11:18.110 --> 11:22.160
<b>Don't worry. There haven't been any
injured people brought over here.</b>

11:22.540 --> 11:24.540
<b>Huh? Tsubaki?</b>

11:25.040 --> 11:26.290
<b>On her right hand...</b>

11:26.660 --> 11:27.960
<b>Thank you.</b>

11:28.290 --> 11:30.710
<b>You take care of yourself,
too, Big Sister.</b>

11:30.710 --> 11:32.340
<b>Goodbye, now.</b>

11:33.210 --> 11:34.880
<b>I confirmed it.</b>

11:34.880 --> 11:37.720
<b>Just like what Mr. Escardos claimed...</b>

11:37.720 --> 11:40.800
<b>Tsubaki Kuruoka has
manifested Command Spells.</b>

11:41.300 --> 11:44.000
<b>You're saying that her Heroic Spirit</b>

11:44.000 --> 11:48.810
<b>is the source of the curse that is
falling upon Snowfield right now?</b>

11:48.810 --> 11:49.650
<b>Yes.</b>

11:50.060 --> 11:53.300
<b>However, as we don't know the
Heroic Spirit's identity,</b>

11:53.300 --> 11:55.150
<b>we can't recklessly attack them.</b>

11:55.150 --> 11:57.360
<b>On top of that, the location
is not suitable for that.</b>

11:57.860 --> 11:59.350
<b>I will use the pretext of an accident</b>

11:59.350 --> 12:01.870
<b>and have the people inside
the hospital evacuate.</b>

12:01.870 --> 12:02.950
<b>Um...</b>

12:03.410 --> 12:08.460
<b>We can also use large-scale Magecraft
to blow up the entire hospital.</b>

12:09.620 --> 12:13.880
<b>Those in the government wouldn't
hesitate to use that tactic.</b>

12:15.000 --> 12:17.220
<b>However, I have shackled our position</b>

12:17.220 --> 12:20.300
<b>as representatives of justice
with my subordinates...</b>

12:20.300 --> 12:22.850
<b>through a pact.</b>

12:23.390 --> 12:27.390
<b>Before I deem sacrificing this girl
to be the most justified move...</b>

12:27.390 --> 12:30.520
<b>I'd like to check off
all possibilities and be</b>

12:30.520 --> 12:32.690
<b>absolutely positive it is our only option.</b>

12:33.310 --> 12:34.520
<b>That's good!</b>

12:34.860 --> 12:36.400
<b>I'm very relieved!</b>

12:36.980 --> 12:38.530
<b>Of what?</b>

12:38.530 --> 12:41.070
<b>If you guys had agreed with
my suggestion from the get-go,</b>

12:41.070 --> 12:43.240
<b>I thought I wouldn't be able
to join forces with you!</b>

12:44.120 --> 12:46.080
<b>You tested me?</b>

12:46.080 --> 12:47.330
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

12:50.250 --> 12:50.920
<b>However...</b>

12:51.420 --> 12:55.040
<b>I will say that if damage
spreads any further,</b>

12:55.040 --> 12:56.880
<b>I will point my gun at her.</b>

12:57.300 --> 13:00.300
<b>Yes! You've proven yourself
by telling me head-on,</b>

13:00.300 --> 13:02.720
<b>so I can feel assured in introducing you!</b>

13:03.890 --> 13:07.280
<b>I did a 27-step encryption on my end,</b>

13:07.280 --> 13:09.770
<b>and they've placed measures
on their end, as well.</b>

13:09.770 --> 13:12.520
<b>So, I don't think anyone
will eavesdrop on us.</b>

13:14.900 --> 13:16.110
<b>Who are you?</b>

13:16.610 --> 13:19.940
<b>I am the instructor of Modern Magecraft
Theories at the Clock Tower.</b>

13:19.940 --> 13:23.700
<b>I usually borrow the title
of "Lord El-Melloi II."</b>

13:24.280 --> 13:28.080
<b>However, for you lot, this other name
should be better at ringing a bell.</b>

13:30.080 --> 13:32.080
<b>"Waver Velvet."</b>

13:32.080 --> 13:35.240
<b>I'm just a third-rate Mage
who once participated</b>

13:35.240 --> 13:37.800
<b>in the Holy Grail War of Fuyuki.</b>

13:40.510 --> 13:43.180
<b>I'd like to confirm the combative
forces of each faction.</b>

13:43.630 --> 13:45.050
<b>In terms of sheer magnitude,</b>

13:45.050 --> 13:47.930
<b>the Police Chief and Dumas duo
should be the greatest...</b>

13:47.930 --> 13:50.890
<b>as they can move ordinary
police officers, as well.</b>

13:51.850 --> 13:54.600
<b>What about the clan led by Tiné Chelc?</b>

13:55.400 --> 13:59.820
<b>Fifty-six foot soldiers are
active within the city.</b>

14:00.400 --> 14:03.280
<b>There should be more in
their base in the valley...</b>

14:03.740 --> 14:07.240
<b>but that's outside of
Watcher's observation range.</b>

14:07.530 --> 14:12.290
<b>Though, the number of actual
forces is probably 46.</b>

14:12.750 --> 14:15.040
<b>The others are either spies
from other syndicates</b>

14:15.040 --> 14:16.960
<b>or are being swayed by their propositions.</b>

14:17.380 --> 14:19.960
<b>I see. It looks like they're
having a hard time.</b>

14:19.960 --> 14:21.170
<b>Hold on a second.</b>

14:22.050 --> 14:27.140
<b>Flat Escardos and the police chief seem
to have formed an alliance just now.</b>

14:27.800 --> 14:32.140
<b>They're going to start a secret operation
at the Central Hospital tonight.</b>

14:33.100 --> 14:35.440
<b>Lord El-Melloi II.</b>

14:35.770 --> 14:38.610
<b>He's a greater armchair
detective than rumors say.</b>

14:39.230 --> 14:40.570
<b>I know, right?</b>

14:40.570 --> 14:41.360
<b>Regardless...</b>

14:41.360 --> 14:44.450
<b>I'm relieved both of you
are really good people!</b>

14:47.570 --> 14:51.700
<b>We already had ascertained the
situation about Tsubaki Kuruoka.</b>

14:52.040 --> 14:55.410
<b>Her parents were natural born Mages,</b>

14:55.410 --> 14:56.580
<b>and they used their daughter...</b>

14:57.080 --> 14:59.880
<b>as a subject for Magecraft experiments.</b>

15:01.340 --> 15:03.920
<b>It seems the objective
of their alliance...</b>

15:03.920 --> 15:07.840
<b>is to rescue the Master in the
hospital from her Servant.</b>

15:08.550 --> 15:10.220
<b>Is she captive?</b>

15:10.220 --> 15:15.270
<b>No. That Master is a
comatose... a sleeping girl.</b>

15:15.810 --> 15:16.770
<b>Oh, but...</b>

15:17.980 --> 15:20.980
<b>That expression may perhaps
be a suitable phrase.</b>

15:21.610 --> 15:25.740
<b>The parents raised their
daughter very, very preciously.</b>

15:26.070 --> 15:28.990
<b>As if putting their favorite
bird inside a birdcage.</b>

15:31.120 --> 15:32.950
<b>You could say her current self...</b>

15:32.950 --> 15:35.410
<b>has been set free.</b>

15:36.120 --> 15:37.330
<b>For the first time in her life...</b>

15:38.120 --> 15:41.590
<b>she was able to go to the
outside world that she admired.</b>

15:43.630 --> 15:46.590
<b>However, the possibility of
the operation failing is high.</b>

15:47.130 --> 15:48.050
<b>Why's that?</b>

15:48.380 --> 15:51.930
<b>I told you, there are moles everywhere.</b>

15:52.350 --> 15:54.720
<b>What you'd call "corrupted cops."</b>

15:55.100 --> 15:57.020
<b>The police chief...</b>

15:57.020 --> 15:58.980
<b>surely doesn't think that
one of the Clan Calatin...</b>

15:59.400 --> 16:03.070
<b>is a henchman for the Scladio Family...</b>

16:03.070 --> 16:04.860
<b>of all things.</b>

16:06.030 --> 16:08.320
<b>Is that girl going to be murdered?</b>

16:08.910 --> 16:10.820
<b>You don't like it?</b>

16:11.200 --> 16:12.530
<b>Perhaps so.</b>

16:13.120 --> 16:16.370
<b>My boy, can you actually be hesitating?</b>

16:17.710 --> 16:21.330
<b>Francesca told me to do as I like. But...</b>

16:22.420 --> 16:24.210
<b>doing as I like...</b>

16:24.800 --> 16:26.050
<b>I don't understand it too much.</b>

16:32.550 --> 16:34.180
<b>I'll say this just in case...</b>

16:34.640 --> 16:37.930
<b>but if you value your life,
don't head over there.</b>

16:40.650 --> 16:43.360
<b>I figured out where that vampire is.</b>

16:49.320 --> 16:52.570
<b>I want to talk to you directly.
Is that all right...</b>

16:52.950 --> 16:53.820
<b>Assassin?</b>

16:55.740 --> 16:56.700
<b>There's one person...</b>

16:57.290 --> 17:02.040
<b>I'd like you to get rid of and stage
it like an accident or natural death.</b>

17:03.250 --> 17:06.250
<b>If thou proceed, thou cannot turn back.</b>

17:08.170 --> 17:11.770
<b>Know if thy conviction
degrades into a fake,</b>

17:11.770 --> 17:14.720
<b>the curse in its entirety
will fall back upon thee...</b>

17:15.050 --> 17:18.220
<b>and consume thee whole.</b>

17:20.940 --> 17:24.810
<b>I would sacrifice all of Magecraft
for the United States.</b>

17:25.860 --> 17:27.860
<b>If it is for this nation...</b>

17:28.150 --> 17:31.360
<b>I wouldn't even hesitate to kill citizens.</b>

17:32.450 --> 17:33.860
<b>I see.</b>

17:33.860 --> 17:38.290
<b>Mr. Police Chief wants to use the
Holy Church to his advantage.</b>

17:38.830 --> 17:40.910
<b>Depending on how the operation pans out,</b>

17:40.910 --> 17:43.620
<b>we want you to take care
of one Master. That's all.</b>

17:45.130 --> 17:46.420
<b>By the way, you are?</b>

17:46.960 --> 17:48.960
<b>You don't look like a police officer.</b>

17:48.960 --> 17:50.340
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

17:50.340 --> 17:51.800
<b>My name is Flat!</b>

17:52.380 --> 17:54.680
<b>I'm the Master for Berserker!</b>

17:54.680 --> 17:58.140
<b>I'm counting on you as the
Overseer of the Holy Grail War!</b>

17:58.140 --> 17:58.850
<b>Oh?</b>

18:00.020 --> 18:04.230
<b>We finally have a Master who
acknowledges me as Overseer?</b>

18:04.730 --> 18:06.610
<b>I'm Hansa Cervantes.</b>

18:07.270 --> 18:10.110
<b>Um, I'll apologize if this is rude...</b>

18:10.900 --> 18:15.070
<b>but Mr. Hansa, is about 70 percent
of your body made of machines?</b>

18:15.410 --> 18:16.700
<b>You can tell?</b>

18:17.120 --> 18:20.950
<b>Yes. It was something I
couldn't understand at first.</b>

18:20.950 --> 18:24.290
<b>Oh, that's amazing! I've
never met a cyborg before!</b>

18:25.000 --> 18:27.210
<b>Can you launch rocket punches and stuff?</b>

18:27.210 --> 18:28.750
<b>Maybe even a drill?</b>

18:29.460 --> 18:33.300
<b>My fist doesn't detach, but
my arm extends three meters.</b>

18:33.300 --> 18:35.220
<b>And a drill? That's a secret.</b>

18:37.550 --> 18:39.310
<b>I'm so touched!</b>

18:39.310 --> 18:42.810
<b>If you don't mind a Mage from the
Clock Tower, can I shake your hand?</b>

18:44.270 --> 18:46.810
<b>You've got some good taste.</b>

18:47.690 --> 18:51.320
<b>If you get bored of Magecraft, you
should convert over to the Holy Church.</b>

18:51.650 --> 18:55.450
<b>Father Hansa is revealing
his hand to a Mage.</b>

18:55.450 --> 18:56.570
<b>Is that okay?</b>

18:56.570 --> 19:01.160
<b>We can't do anything about it.
Hansa is like a kid inside.</b>

19:01.990 --> 19:04.410
<b><i>I have already gotten rid of
the people in the vicinity.</i></b>

19:04.790 --> 19:06.870
<b>At the time of the operation's start...</b>

19:06.870 --> 19:09.350
<b><i>we will use Magecraft to put the
people inside the hospital to sleep</i></b>

19:09.350 --> 19:10.380
<b><i>so we may hurry inside.</i></b>

19:10.960 --> 19:13.130
<b><i>Our objective is securing
Tsubaki Kuruoka...</i></b>

19:13.130 --> 19:14.880
<b><i>a Master. Nothing else.</i></b>

19:15.220 --> 19:18.840
<b><i>Please make sure to not
cause injury to civilians.</i></b>

19:20.100 --> 19:23.600
<b>Nothing less from a survivor
of the Holy Grail War.</b>

19:23.980 --> 19:26.060
<b>Both Lord El-Melloi II...</b>

19:26.850 --> 19:29.770
<b>and his student...</b>

19:31.020 --> 19:33.480
<b>I'm glad we settled things well.</b>

19:34.650 --> 19:38.160
<b>We must be grateful to the police chief.</b>

19:38.990 --> 19:43.950
<b>The theories of Tsubaki Kuruoka's
Heroic Spirit your mentor spoke of...</b>

19:44.450 --> 19:47.920
<b>and the plan he came up with
were both quite marvelous.</b>

19:47.920 --> 19:49.350
<b>Nobody in the Clock Tower</b>

19:49.350 --> 19:53.300
<b>can win against Professor in
negotiations without Magecraft!</b>

19:54.460 --> 19:57.340
<b>Why are you trying to save that child?</b>

19:57.720 --> 19:59.510
<b>It's the obvious thing to do.</b>

20:00.640 --> 20:02.260
<b>That's not true.</b>

20:02.600 --> 20:06.480
<b>Indeed, you have a looseness about
you that's unfitting for a Mage.</b>

20:06.880 --> 20:07.930
<b>However,</b>

20:07.930 --> 20:12.270
<b>it's all too reckless to expose yourself
to someone who is normally your enemy...</b>

20:12.270 --> 20:14.280
<b>for someone else's sake.</b>

20:14.900 --> 20:16.820
<b>It's a simple story.</b>

20:17.530 --> 20:21.450
<b>I just thought if the Professor were
in my shoes, he would save her.</b>

20:22.200 --> 20:28.290
<b>Before I am a Mage of the Escardos Family,
I'm Flat of the El-Melloi Class.</b>

20:28.290 --> 20:33.210
<b>To abandon that child here is betraying
Professor and all of my peers.</b>

20:34.210 --> 20:40.260
<b>I am scared of doing that just as
much as losing my purpose as a Mage.</b>

20:41.140 --> 20:42.390
<b>I see.</b>

20:42.890 --> 20:46.720
<b>If you say you're scared,
I am forced to understand.</b>

20:47.600 --> 20:50.650
<b>And Mr. Jack, why don't you oppose?</b>

20:50.650 --> 20:51.310
<b>Hmm?</b>

20:51.850 --> 20:54.110
<b>In order to survive the Holy Grail War,</b>

20:54.110 --> 20:57.070
<b>we don't have to reach out
and save a girl, right?</b>

20:58.190 --> 21:00.030
<b>It's simple.</b>

21:00.490 --> 21:05.830
<b>I was merely influenced by
you and your mentor, as well.</b>

21:05.830 --> 21:09.790
<b>Then, that makes you a student
of the El-Melloi Class, too!</b>

21:11.120 --> 21:13.770
<b>You harbor within you a great divergence</b>

21:13.770 --> 21:17.510
<b>from the world that you
yourself aren't aware of.</b>

21:18.210 --> 21:20.930
<b>I was terrified of that, as well.</b>

21:22.510 --> 21:25.150
<b>Humans all live with a sense of divergence</b>

21:25.150 --> 21:28.180
<b>from this world somewhere
within themselves.</b>

21:28.180 --> 21:31.890
<b>But upon speaking with your
mentor, I felt relief.</b>

21:31.890 --> 21:33.730
<b>Right. Professor is—</b>

21:33.730 --> 21:36.480
<b>Not for the fact that he is your mentor.</b>

21:36.860 --> 21:39.040
<b>It was because you felt
a sense of reverence</b>

21:39.040 --> 21:41.450
<b>for how the said mentor lives his life.</b>

21:41.780 --> 21:44.240
<b>As long as you have that spirit...</b>

21:44.240 --> 21:45.530
<b>you will always...</b>

21:45.530 --> 21:48.950
<b>be able to overcome the
divergence within yourself.</b>

21:52.750 --> 21:53.870
<b>Something is coming!</b>

21:53.870 --> 21:55.130
<b>What is that?</b>

22:07.470 --> 22:09.970
<b>EPISODE 8</b>
